{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le08ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le08ob02re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le08ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le08ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What kind of stories can you tell me?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">George</span>: Oh! The stories I could tell you! ... I remember this one time in high school, my friends and I snuck out of class and drove to the next town. Gordie and I were the only ones with driver's licenses and cars, so we used to drive everyone everywhere.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le08ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "There was a roller skating rink in the next town over - all the cool kids used to hang out there. One day we drove out there and ended up getting lost on the back roads. Of course there was no GPS back then, so we had to hope we'd come across a main road so we could get back onto the highway. Luckily we ran into a rancher and he pointed us in the right direction! We were traveling the wrong way the whole time!", "id": 2, "time": "23000"}, {"image": "engenn7le08ob02re2img03.jpg", "text": "We made it back in time for dinner. My mother would always have it ready at 6:30 on the dot. I've never been as happy as I was when I was a teenager. Those were the days ... young, innocent and free!", "id": 3, "time": "58000"}]}}], "_data": []}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "  I can talk about friendship and relationships.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about habits in the past.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about people's past experiences. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"conten